@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000

### Feature mode (always available)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/customer/dependencies

### SQL catalogue (requires the opt-in backend)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/customer/products

### Durable order; retry with the SAME ID if dispatch fails
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/customer/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "9dc7009a-8460-4dd4-87bb-dc19b18298b2",
  "productId": "monitoring-starter"
}

### Processing status; accepted/queued is not fulfilled
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/customer/orders/9dc7009a-8460-4dd4-87bb-dc19b18298b2

### Invalid idempotency identifier
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/customer/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "productId": "monitoring-starter"
}
